-- KAN-517. Listed units whose served row is pinned outside the centre's outline go
-- to the centre's coordinate (decisions.md: "A listed tenant nobody can place goes at
-- the mall's own coordinate"), so the mall inventory shows them with their floor.
-- Our own rows move; an Overture row is withdrawn and replaced by our row, same type
-- and floor. Gare do Oriente units and Colombo's 100 MONTADITOS are outside by the
-- owner's word and stay where they are. UBBO 18, Strada 2, Colombo 25, Amoreiras 12,
-- Vasco da Gama 11. Nothing deleted. Idempotent.

